OL,3,GNEWSAFunding for Cranleigh's new
OL,4,Aleisure centre in doubt
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe future of a leisure centre in
OL,7,FSurrey is uncertain after a council
OL,8,Ffailed to guarantee funding for its
OL,9,Fplanned multi-million pound rebuild.
OL,11,FIn January, residents were told by the
OL,12,Fleader of Waverley Borough Council that
OL,13,Fthe old site of Cranleigh Leisure
OL,14,FCentre had to be replaced with a
OL,15,Fstate-of-the-art eco friendly building
OL,16,For it would "inevitably close".
OL,18,FNow, with the #36m project passing to
OL,19,Fthe new West Surrey Council, its
OL,20,Fleadership has rowed back on funding
OL,21,Fpromises.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
