OL,3,GNEWSAFunding for Cranleigh's new
OL,4,Aleisure centre in doubt
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Leslie Rice (Lib Dem),
OL,7,Fportfolio holder for finance on West
OL,8,FSurrey Shadow Authority, said:
OL,9,F"Everything will be evidenced based, we
OL,10,Fwill have to see what the facts are as
OL,11,Fwe prepare the budget."
